    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d333">

                <pb facs="0351" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg339"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.6211/71: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-08-23T16:00:00+03:00">August 23, 1939—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 23—10:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>461. Ribbentrop arrived promptly at 1:00 by air and was met at the airport on
                    behalf of the Soviet Government by Potemkin, the Commander of the Moscow
                    garrison, and other Soviet officials. He was to see Molotov at 3 o’clock this
                    afternoon.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
